OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CToday:FAny early mist or fog quickly   
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a largely dry and    
OL,7,Fbright day with sunny spells, although 
OL,8,Fa few light showers are possible       
OL,9,Facross Norfolk at times. Remaining     
OL,10,Frather chilly with generally light     
OL,11,Fwinds.                                 
OL,13,CTonight:FBreaks in the cloud will      
OL,14,Fallow temperatures to fall and frost   
OL,15,Fto form before turning cloudy with     
OL,16,Fpatchy rain in the west by the         
OL,17,Fmorning. Feeling chilly with light     
OL,18,Fwinds.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
