OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with patchy rain at    
OL,6,Ffirst. Cloud will break in the east    
OL,7,Fduring the afternoon with sunny        
OL,8,Fspells, becoming cloudy again          
OL,9,Fovernight. Winds will increase,        
OL,10,Fbecoming increasingly breezy.          
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fand mostly dry through the period,     
OL,14,Fwith some isolated showers on          
OL,15,FThursday. Winds easing but feeling     
OL,16,Fcool with temperatures slightly below  
OL,17,Faverage.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
